  "entries": [
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fed1870ac13ab49b3f8829a5",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "呀——玩得真开心耶，训练员。",
      "source_fingerprint": "fead768f5325c96350c1a419dcece927df1e759572114bcb1161c6b58dffe9d8",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1020",
        "2035"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3d0c3c7dbefbd8e8648ef3b3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "ほいほーい。",
      "source_fingerprint": "6b4e70ab74dbbfd458210d0723cdd7fe7676c9f7814b83f396ce91504b5bb7c9",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1020",
        "23015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:167eadb9004bb1aeeb1bbbde",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "做得好，做得好——♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "4129c2ff8c874d2ca42241807a84bebdff0831db79f5fccc2c4666ca6b84cda8",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1020",
        "30000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:021d981f99b10e118d0d6e02",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "总之就当作肯做就能做到咯～",
      "source_fingerprint": "de2541da30bdeb218550fa26fe52d909c34ed929bb816d8ae9d92e58c4883541",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1020",
        "30001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1a4303ed47375291a6dd074d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "应该算是还可以吧——？",
      "source_fingerprint": "fe1697186fce25e8b9f1a7a7e15d58904a581fac34f28144bc7b9874799d7552",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1020",
        "30002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:494f5f75cba28b17744f4354",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "哎呀——没能成功啊——啊哈哈——",
      "source_fingerprint": "6548aec511ac6cd36202d4731a55096a7a422c1b8d251e99f268c36718bca7ed",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1020",
        "30003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:423ee4cbf6efb3a6e7a61907",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "多么令人满意的结果啊……哦哆！？唔～呵呵。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c5e41752b38e9f5bb9d331405a928d9bee5cd0acd3946a88e99a706ff21da1cc",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1020",
        "30004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8e7bbf40075438cf43594a04",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "欢呼声好像……比预期的还要大？",
      "source_fingerprint": "2bb803de3dc77b1e7465239ae4d64dabd447604944db615febefa205c857e344",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1020",
        "30005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6dce692e296c0204873b5ef3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "将这场胜利献给你。\r\n……不是骗你的哦？",
      "source_fingerprint": "0f92bbe4bbf9d7cf9166c95e9c9a1947b9578540c9bc402c9e0e475e27498027",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1020",
        "30006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e72b32844819b05eda9b28a2",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "比预料之中还要响亮的欢呼声……吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "a2b77b7140a63e4ab759cab7ea972525fb4b38ef0d8d4ca6f0ddd68822bf86c1",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1020",
        "30007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c36550c8ac919438c36c9014",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "那我就上场咯——",
      "source_fingerprint": "1bb0e49dd6813c30355fecd6d3b3398c2d77cf59aedcd70d9545136f9b749da0",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1020",
        "31000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b980b5dfb04a7a88847909c6",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "……来了！就是现在——！",
      "source_fingerprint": "373f6d6af1d9ff5dca8520f20a268b049ba3045550d082ea34b6408feba9b930",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1020",
        "40000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ab398f3f1d9d746f618232ec",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "富士同学吗……她每次来美浦宿舍的时候，\r\n我们都会猜谁又会被她迷住。亚马逊同学嘛……\r\n倒是感觉她一直在生气来着。",
      "source_fingerprint": "6bfc3d53598684d94749088b4569701a38054921a14e1a4fc7c033d8913dcd5b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1020",
        "400001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5c0c5cd7014ede6a911b9bd9",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "呼啊～……那个啊。所谓的幸福，\r\n说不定指的就是睡到午后吧。\r\n好啦，今天的饭会是什么呢～？",
      "source_fingerprint": "9d0b76168ddce71a34fc282a012f9f3b1c72ec9e2152d7200551e3d8bddd80eb",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1020",
        "400002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1f1cd936b7b2d35feb999d49",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "知ってるよ、キングが諦め悪いって\r\nことくらい。対策、さんざん\r\n苦労させられたんだからさ～。",
      "source_fingerprint": "a3164db88fb493d7e3f8b4891d423d2efaf8451fdb9fe2043d48375ebb090cd3",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1020",
        "400003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b558aa228bb61f1afacf7570",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "以前在比赛里输掉……之后就\r\n沉迷上钓鱼了来着。那时候的\r\n冠军――爷爷真的好强啊",
      "source_fingerprint": "3bd9e03849e31ce72350bad6c58ae33703c34a4edbb5203d8850e80a802d9994",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1020",
        "400004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3c83b6a1b84737175ea15805",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "青酱是这么想的……要是大家，\r\n都能像我这样生活就好了。\r\n虽然那样世道可就要乱套了呢☆",
      "source_fingerprint": "7d41206410cb1a2c92501681833464f10829e0fb663ee827b6d35a21cc0f8992",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1020",
        "400008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e565a8ac64a5781fa55f0729",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "呼～嘶呼……嗯！大鱼来了～！\r\n……呀哈，上当了吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "53b2dd8776e0afd52148115257a26e8142a1b17e4862145a9ccdf13ddd581258",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1020",
        "40001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:35f5746c56d9bd5e25a15d2a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这次虽然只是一场表演而已……\r\n但总有一天，我会将真正的——\r\n什么的，试着说了一下～",
      "source_fingerprint": "a9fc8098e5e18e68bef0ae60d14a547bf12bf5092faca1ce783d8a1c43aa1b54",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1020",
        "400010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:879aee92f6b360c29ce818bf",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "哇，累死了……\r\n让我们和美丽的花儿一起嬉戏，\r\n然后获得治愈吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "8992c4d621ca775ed33f6edab89ccc5b7379c56be6d5aa10fd86158028d12202",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1020",
        "400014"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8bd6995d99b3cab048e1d90f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "那就乘上这股风吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "b2ccb41c493f0111591d91f8b3aec4e3446cc2584f07bd537b85d052a8f48293",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1020",
        "40003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c1c58d895375545d50556c44",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "真没劲啊……才怪☆\r\nIt's show time！……吓了一跳吧？",
      "source_fingerprint": "dea4155b62e99646ca068b688b0cb31b3c52aa456e79e41156863be0dee1ce00",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1020",
        "40004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:540e671cc491acac2d4e921d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "くぁ…っ。早起きでねむ～～。\r\n――甲板の端っこで、\r\nお昼寝しちゃダメかな。",
      "source_fingerprint": "2417f7daace9ce26133572bf7e6d66aa5b35c142043decb2577c55c654840c44",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1020",
        "400079"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:df9e68e2a9894bfdfa5705f3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "あんなに堂々とされたら\r\nみんな認めるしかないんじゃない？\r\n…かっこよかったよ、キング。",
      "source_fingerprint": "469d99698f0c99bd0824ac025a5c2aebaf4f28842c86a7372697cad61ce8775a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1020",
        "400080"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:200ca4e86a2cb8e478711dda",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "那我去咯——",
      "source_fingerprint": "49c87dc39f67e8774041ff4f0c5da95bb2529cec51d206eb8280c05d02c5aac1",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1020",
        "410000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:59b05fc5f4dcba46fec6d724",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "耶——",
      "source_fingerprint": "ee327d3092c4afc6b71659ccfc729029aef99544817e688ab1fa87c873e2d321",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1020",
        "410001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:46bbe4040fa689d795a4f693",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "呀哈哈——",
      "source_fingerprint": "03f0f02e2f7841d29d7e7f75bccd3cf24118e01407f5995eb8426554eff86828",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1020",
        "410002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:26da40b6030957a8b3702371",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "呀哈哈——",
      "source_fingerprint": "03f0f02e2f7841d29d7e7f75bccd3cf24118e01407f5995eb8426554eff86828",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1020",
        "410003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5ab43f94779bdb7be61b1352",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "嘿嘿。",
      "source_fingerprint": "6d0212cb1ec9201ff17e6acf0ea2d70e06cf290b6bc356f0e84aed5329a8a9e7",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1020",
        "410004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a54454690d3352c73dc823fd",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "嘿嘿。",
      "source_fingerprint": "6d0212cb1ec9201ff17e6acf0ea2d70e06cf290b6bc356f0e84aed5329a8a9e7",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1020",
        "410005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:525c307cd856714abe9b339f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "诶嘿☆",
      "source_fingerprint": "4f54137d60e821b7cae09b47fa2e665f5be43a1b8519738aecd59be7a101532f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1020",
        "410006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:96e657fc83ead65e1c657ff4",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "诶嘿☆",
      "source_fingerprint": "4f54137d60e821b7cae09b47fa2e665f5be43a1b8519738aecd59be7a101532f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1020",
        "410007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d74f8e52e041075314e6a90b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "诶嘿☆",
      "source_fingerprint": "4f54137d60e821b7cae09b47fa2e665f5be43a1b8519738aecd59be7a101532f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1020",
        "410008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:350af17cb99dd5d72747b8fc",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "嘿嘿——\r\n这时候就该热闹起来才对哦——？",
      "source_fingerprint": "3e4f7c4f3f7eabf3756aca98452bed8a93cb07467e841f4c8beed20e526c9b78",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1020",
        "60000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a2b064114ecc3015d6b2411d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "那我就来去唱一下吧——",
      "source_fingerprint": "0cbd174ca68982dae9c1c8c5c3c3f5d4f2bbe319b71781a09c43cfb409630d4a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1020",
        "60001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8f59f9bf3820e64fe59cbab9",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我们一起轻～松度过吧——",
      "source_fingerprint": "bf3c482c9cf2b7110fbabadf4675b973d28aad0cf2ba6842a96b904dafa624a9",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1020",
        "70000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:93379f709f45259293c4f326",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "很久很久以前，\r\n某个新人训练员和赛马娘……\r\n哎呀？讲这太多余了是吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "1fd0ea0482217f2581d4341668cf3813d3134df0fe9a7c3bb0141229ed2268ad",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1020",
        "70001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9e1841ce809011cc9e47a11f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "不用烦恼每天要穿什么！\r\n制服最棒了——！",
      "source_fingerprint": "3b53d32ee66057324b7fe9989d1d770c3f9f29335d2616489ff72f8eb67cfc61",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1020",
        "70004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b0c8e41df121d2279789d629",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "跑完还要演唱会……其实很辛苦的耶～",
      "source_fingerprint": "79a0e4a5503e46ba4dda7f2b73b9f8662486a95808f4ab9e6d6d8f0459d479ad",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1020",
        "70008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:44d13d4f803fb3fd5681835a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这是我最棒的衣服哦——",
      "source_fingerprint": "4e7408fb5dfb9c0bd1fd04f281dddfb48eaf7ac1a9c81b065323a9f73a2e3790",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1020",
        "70009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:44e52159ff1f94634e6f98fc",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "哎呀？我没有穿反吧？",
      "source_fingerprint": "878863a76ffdb3d73e9305f9e52e476baeb6e8b6bb63b7c66f4a5dcf50d14d1d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1020",
        "70010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:db0ef0d4f609159781b1979c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "青酱我可爱吗？呀☆",
      "source_fingerprint": "ec54abfc2245c86ecb518cd8e267e1d6deeca343a563638afd031433d3f041f0",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1020",
        "70014"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:18334320647befd461bb4113",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "难得可以跑GＩ，\r\n就要好好地拟定策略啊。",
      "source_fingerprint": "742cc58e63d1230bfa75abca5a4db1c173f3c5b3acc1580fcebaa4af533f1e9e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1020",
        "70015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ef3e1eb16feaa5c21c9d253d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "是盛装打扮版小青哦☆",
      "source_fingerprint": "9f7d84673d491451eced1a133bc2f7df83f19bb26e37b895e22ba20e12ef20d0",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1020",
        "70016"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:720f531fb9f8912b5f9d7df1",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "摄影time。",
      "source_fingerprint": "294abf0b89900640aa254ab3f35b9b5f9f3b45df3ddbdbcf068711d0cbe06d80",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1020",
        "70017"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cbdb172084bc3ba4eeb72dc5",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "那我去咯——",
      "source_fingerprint": "49c87dc39f67e8774041ff4f0c5da95bb2529cec51d206eb8280c05d02c5aac1",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1020",
        "70018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:98cbcee837173d84a93ad0f2",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "会有什么样的结果就敬请期待咯。",
      "source_fingerprint": "dbc3382a0bae3f5a12319e8bf1e3df71f7f099a271f5ee8551797ee77f289d78",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1020",
        "70019"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:24ac10d45595ac62fe1147bf",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "无论散步、钓鱼还是午睡都可以穿这套解决～",
      "source_fingerprint": "98d57040db196d487b447e5c7e4b3404ed31593db2bf24f96bae70ce45ca9f32",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1020",
        "70020"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bfdfcea126e5798b6fc44a2d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "小青的穿搭铁则是宽松舒适。",
      "source_fingerprint": "cc4db03313741aa352e508f76ad9e054d73c53d08a161a5f97445fa4d3059134",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1020",
        "70021"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fbda1cbe2da3e28c0bea0e64",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "不用烦恼每天要穿什么！\r\n制服最棒了——！",
      "source_fingerprint": "3b53d32ee66057324b7fe9989d1d770c3f9f29335d2616489ff72f8eb67cfc61",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1020",
        "71004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8b714dcef4111ccc074a1c3a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "跑完就要开演唱会……\r\n其实很辛苦的耶～",
      "source_fingerprint": "c71800ef249b7d5069a53d492cd303035a802430088a3c6c33a850f4a2f4bcba",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1020",
        "71008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d8e086e5325c6f2147aeec5a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这是我最棒的衣服哦——",
      "source_fingerprint": "4e7408fb5dfb9c0bd1fd04f281dddfb48eaf7ac1a9c81b065323a9f73a2e3790",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1020",
        "71009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d3b2341ad7d3aedbe8d52cdf",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "哎呀？我没有穿反吧？",
      "source_fingerprint": "878863a76ffdb3d73e9305f9e52e476baeb6e8b6bb63b7c66f4a5dcf50d14d1d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1020",
        "71010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:227edcd7631885babe936e3a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "青酱我可爱吗？呀☆",
      "source_fingerprint": "ec54abfc2245c86ecb518cd8e267e1d6deeca343a563638afd031433d3f041f0",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1020",
        "71014"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a526c0e2244050b4e6f34d1a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "难得可以跑GＩ，\r\n就要好好地拟定策略啊。",
      "source_fingerprint": "742cc58e63d1230bfa75abca5a4db1c173f3c5b3acc1580fcebaa4af533f1e9e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1020",
        "71015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:97b3c5c3c37769357be49f4b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "是盛装打扮版小青哦☆",
      "source_fingerprint": "9f7d84673d491451eced1a133bc2f7df83f19bb26e37b895e22ba20e12ef20d0",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1020",
        "71016"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:24b3ee66e04b5401869e0130",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "摄影time。",
      "source_fingerprint": "294abf0b89900640aa254ab3f35b9b5f9f3b45df3ddbdbcf068711d0cbe06d80",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1020",
        "71017"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:70b7a8cf8110a282135608fa",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "那我去咯——",
      "source_fingerprint": "49c87dc39f67e8774041ff4f0c5da95bb2529cec51d206eb8280c05d02c5aac1",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1020",
        "71018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:88b5193d089a03c1b5b3dc9e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "会有什么样的结果就敬请期待咯。",
      "source_fingerprint": "dbc3382a0bae3f5a12319e8bf1e3df71f7f099a271f5ee8551797ee77f289d78",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1020",
        "71019"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0f41a212e86cc261008d07e9",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "辛苦了",
      "source_fingerprint": "bd96bf364b8b21a3bb94efcf4ef82feb1bc34cf02203524e7949dbd19151dd13",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1020",
        "80000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2cf1757ed31216713238abba",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "诶，向我发起挑战是认真的吗～？\r\n会输掉哦～？指我自己。",
      "source_fingerprint": "334c7a05d841d6e8cc7ab79a5817f94adc538a4955f1da1bcf66716e48f521d3",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1020",
        "81000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c48ecf3dfc34033dc7213cb8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "哎呀……真的好强啊。\r\n但是我对一直输这种事，\r\n可不怎么喜欢哦",
      "source_fingerprint": "5ad556450196631c357c207c5efd23f6e09f1cbaace707c83cd3307ae61ef7d5",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1020",
        "81001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2d30c5b6327ff3bbc6b7daf4",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "训练员，一早就发现奇迹了耶！\r\n你看……没想到！\r\n青酱竟然来上学了！",
      "source_fingerprint": "c859bd790bd27d9c1ede29fd2696fdd280aece1705313e9290c5133c3b627f63",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1020",
        "90000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:863b4f81aa734d3411d53004",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "早啊——\r\n今天也要悠哉随性地度过一天哦——",
      "source_fingerprint": "7f01f926dc5a9ac963887fb3ce15ea2a072db2b15210730a1a8b2df8cfdae79d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1020",
        "90001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c34026b77f548f598422255e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "呼～上午辛苦了。\r\n所以下午我要休息——\r\n……咦？不行？怎么这样～",
      "source_fingerprint": "e2f89f839a5dd5d7a6c45f6435f2dd5c74bf352e9d0f556b847b469590a9e509",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1020",
        "90002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e4605e7f972997a852fec14a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "哎呀哎呀？\r\n该不会是来约青酱一起午睡的吧？\r\n那我会很开心耶～呀哈哈～",
      "source_fingerprint": "3f9f67d4799c57f7a9c9ade9127b953a1047f9bfe5fe20dac82f1b637c3e09c1",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1020",
        "90003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3eb519db042cb2dac71a7f0d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "哦哦，看见星星了……\r\n这就代表……要开始准备夜钓了！\r\n……咦？不对吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "9b70da9e2e12e78d6a7db545765e7437a58da3ad01fd30f9fb4b85eb630414fc",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1020",
        "90004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8ea6658d6559fe99e8a91881",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "一边看电视一边喝茶。\r\n这对我来说是无比珍贵的时间……\r\n所以我想要先回家了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "2becc53ed3c649b75016a7e5597f8b27d3d4ecf36bf0d846f1f6c08a3d8a0fd8",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1020",
        "90005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:87c80e9a268c537eb4060239",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "只专心寻找蒲公英棉毛的日子。\r\n人生也是需要这种日子的……\r\n譬如说像是明天之类的～偷瞄。",
      "source_fingerprint": "111455ef28e0a16aafc529d8a954a11745abd32bf23bc5888d2b0f7a3af73d90",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1020",
        "90006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a9739845b2450fa03758ca3e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "天气一直很热呢～\r\n……图书室不知道有没有空位——\r\n唉～我需要凉爽的地方啊～",
      "source_fingerprint": "9477d366b0837e3495a9b53fc37f9a80a0a402d76ed9bb40a62d45599a10ecb4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1020",
        "90007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0f62670fd973a14845e91f40",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "秋天到处都能找到蓬松的落叶堆！\r\n也就代表，\r\n在哪都可以睡觉的意思，耶嘿。",
      "source_fingerprint": "14576650743493d22b67b1686d8e76f99361bd9c0310b6898ecdb8ff31c601f5",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1020",
        "90008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a3a5f8d7b959b4cd9afd077b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "呀——好冷好冷……\r\n我打算要冬眠了，所以春天的时候，\r\n你再来叫醒我……不行吗～？",
      "source_fingerprint": "61057fd12e69c0a1343437a699640f98bf1dabe328ade8e5328fd224ca1b8ca3",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1020",
        "90009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:454971ff02db60dba4b77714",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "一大清早就整理得这么完美，\r\n小青很了不起吧？\r\n现在正是表扬我的好机会哦～",
      "source_fingerprint": "335f4044771fa0c7174c426d687ce14124e8e168791c39d43c8fa52915f77cb6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1020",
        "90010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7f04856396e064fdf723dec3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "训练员，\r\n我们来喝点红茶什么的吧。\r\n……这可不是在邀请你偷懒哦？",
      "source_fingerprint": "75fbde64b9fb9afc633f140c1cfe3e59c5f5a630dd13623fea08ae87b2e9275e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1020",
        "90011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4bafe87917e95f8be1c74215",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "啊，脖子勒得好难受～\r\n……但我可不会解开哦，真遗憾☆",
      "source_fingerprint": "16384df9a53b48d635a79c7c83bdd22296c6e06e1a0c6eef2725c93e0d6a3725",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1020",
        "90012"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ad0951cd57857d76aaff02e0",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "训练员也去换个衣服，\n把这里当成舞厅吧。\r\n大家一定会被吓一跳的～嘻嘻。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b88234af0e7127a538e0759ac7dd04d583aa76527fc877ed1da8e0cf5510818f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1020",
        "90013"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:31f6a62f6cb3534ddb77a151",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "将训练员任命为\r\n小青王子的仆人。\r\n“摸鱼”的准备就拜托你了♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "8dab4cf0631a099defb89ab5a7dfe2a8a60a8eefc0d3d99b1835b2e6369f64a4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1020",
        "90014"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5a63576444a86c30368600f6",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我看上去很可靠吗？\r\n……偶尔也依靠一下我嘛。\r\n开玩笑的啦。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d51da8b60a385332ef6391b2976565f5e6a085616785d430a934b12a6234645e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1020",
        "90015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6ceac1232f9aa183a24c9d70",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "说到新学期的回忆的话……\r\n小时候觉得开学典礼什么的很麻烦。\r\n就经常躲到空无一人的教室里去。",
      "source_fingerprint": "19eb8128a51cc6f0fe72b83415185d5e3716f6acefba3422158ca732d8877abc",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1020",
        "90016"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1472136b176110991c5861d3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "……其实里面穿着束身衣。\r\n类似浴衣里的毛巾，用于\r\n矫正身形的东西……好热啊。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ad46977722346fbc5733aef1b6c9334567066376d960ee00911cd7e8a3c7498d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1020",
        "90017"
      ]
    }
  ]
}
